  "evidencia": "Page: Flipper (1996 film). Sentence: Flipper is a 1996 adventure film remake of the 1963 film of the same name (which in turn begat a TV series that ran from 1964 to 1967), starring Paul Hogan and Elijah Wood.\nPage: Elijah Wood. Sentence: He is best known for his high-profile leading role as Frodo Baggins in Peter Jackson's epic film trilogy \"The Lord of the Rings\" (2001–03).\nPage: Jessica Wesson. Sentence: She is best known for her recurring role as Jennifer Sudarsky, Brad's (Zachery Ty Bryan) first girlfriend on the sitcom \"Home Improvement\", and having supporting roles in the Universal films \"Casper\" and \"Flipper\" in the 1990s.\nPage: Lightning Jack. Sentence: Lightning Jack is a 1994 American-Australian Western comedy film written by and starring Paul Hogan, as well as Cuba Gooding Jr. and Beverly D'Angelo.",
