        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b4773a10-7352-5c37-b7c3-5103e7fc193e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Paul Hogan, Elijah Wood, Jessica Wesson, Peter Jackson, Zachery Ty Bryan, Cuba Gooding Jr., Beverly D'Angelo\n- Films and TV: Flipper, Flipper (1963 film), Flipper TV series, The Lord of the Rings trilogy, Home Improvement, Casper, Lightning Jack\n- Roles: Frodo Baggins, Jennifer Sudarsky, Brad\n\nFacts:\n- The 1963 film Flipper led to a TV series named Flipper that ran from 1964 to 1967.\n- Lightning Jack is a 1994 American-Australian Western comedy film written by and starring Paul Hogan, and it also stars Cuba Gooding Jr. and Beverly D'Angelo.\n- Flipper is a 1996 adventure film remake of the 1963 film Flipper.\n- The 1996 film Flipper stars Paul Hogan and Elijah Wood.\n- Jessica Wesson is known for her recurring role as Jennifer Sudarsky, who is Brad's first girlfriend, on the sitcom Home Improvement.\n- Brad on Home Improvement is played by Zachery Ty Bryan.\n- Jessica Wesson also had supporting roles in the Universal films Casper and Flipper in the 1990s.\n- Elijah Wood is best known for playing Frodo Baggins in Peter Jackson's The Lord of the Rings film trilogy from 2001 to 2003.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "a86554be-331b-562d-9948-053c8cd2237a",
        "text": "Page: Flipper (1996 film). Sentence: Flipper is a 1996 adventure film remake of the 1963 film of the same name (which in turn begat a TV series that ran from 1964 to 1967), starring Paul Hogan and Elijah Wood.\nPage: Elijah Wood. Sentence: He is best known for his high-profile leading role as Frodo Baggins in Peter Jackson's epic film trilogy \"The Lord of the Rings\" (2001–03).\nPage: Jessica Wesson. Sentence: She is best known for her recurring role as Jennifer Sudarsky, Brad's (Zachery Ty Bryan) first girlfriend on the sitcom \"Home Improvement\", and having supporting roles in the Universal films \"Casper\" and \"Flipper\" in the 1990s.\nPage: Lightning Jack. Sentence: Lightning Jack is a 1994 American-Australian Western comedy film written by and starring Paul Hogan, as well as Cuba Gooding Jr. and Beverly D'Angelo.",
